    "note": "Every cross-section (y, z) is the cubic leaving (0, 10) straight up (the wall carried on) with a derivative 1 x sqrt(10^2 + 20^2) (weight x distance to the line) and reaching (10, 30) with no bend (a natural end): Bezier (0, 10), (0, 10 + chord / 3), its midpoint with the end, (10, 30); area 20 x its length (Simpson)"
  }
